  "schema_version": 2,
  "description": "RAPID mock-interview session templates for PrepVista. Full mocks deliberately run 10-15 minutes and cover ALL 14 question categories with at least one question each (one question per category, 14 total), so a student gets a complete, low-fatigue readiness check in one short sitting. Company types differ by difficulty, not length. Focused drills are even shorter, single-purpose sessions. Difficulty modes (auto/normal/medium/difficult) are requests; each module clamps them to its category's allowed band.",
